# Node identity & BLS signing keys — NEVER commit. Patterns are unanchored so a
# key file generated from ANY working directory (e.g. a test running in a
# subpackage, or a node started from a non-root cwd) is ignored everywhere, not
# just at the repo root. config.BLSFile/PeerFile are relative paths, so their
# on-disk location depends on the process cwd.
